  "title": "Budhi Gandaki valley, day before the 11 Oct landslide — Baseline Imagery",
  "description": "PlanetScope imagery acquired 10 October 2026 over the Chamar massif, Syar river and Budhi Gandaki valley (Gorkha), one day before the 11 October rock(-ice) avalanche and debris flood. Filed under post-event because it postdates the 26 August Rasuwa flood; it serves as the pre-event baseline for the Budhi Gandaki event. 6 scenes; each Item carries the available visual, analytic, udm2 assets.",
